es/sase-ru/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire the mature formatter and plugin catalog paths[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fast_retirements[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fast_retirements: verify and retire prettier_enabled and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin_catalog_scoped_latest, including compatibility cleanup, schema [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]synchronization, focused coverage, and bead closure.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove update-time completion refresh across supported shells[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]completion_soak[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion_soak: gather reproducible unmanaged-install evidence for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion_refresh_on_update across bash, fish, and zsh without changing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the flag definition.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove EpicResume behavior under real stall and handoff races[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]epic_resume_soak[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]epic_resume_soak: exercise epic_resume_gate against controlled stalls, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery, retries, and handoff races and record whether its authored [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]removal gate passes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Measure inherited planner chat value and cost[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]planner_chat_trial[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]planner_chat_trial: compare paired coder handoffs with and without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coder_inh